B.bAi=s(["Bloke sal sa a? Apar\xe8y ki konekte yo ap p\xe8di aks\xe8 l\xe8 yo kontakte s\xe8v\xe8 a. Apar\xe8y offline yo rete limite pa otorizasyon offline yo.","Bloquer cette salle ? Les appareils connect\xe9s perdront l\u2019acc\xe8s au prochain contact serveur. Les appareils hors ligne restent limit\xe9s par leur autorisation locale.","Block this gym? Connected devices lose access at the next server contact. Offline devices remain limited by their local authorization lease."],t.s)
B.bnK=s(["P\xe8m\xe8t sal sa a konekte epi senkronize ank\xf2?","Autoriser cette salle \xe0 se connecter et \xe0 synchroniser \xe0 nouveau ?","Allow this gym to connect and synchronize again?"],t.s)
