B.bHG=s(["GymDesk itilize kat QR san non ni foto. Chak kat gen yon nimewo epi yon k\xf2d PIN manm lan antre l\xe8 l rive.","GymDesk utilise des cartes QR anonymes. Chaque carte porte un num\xe9ro et le membre saisit son code PIN \xe0 l\u2019entr\xe9e.","GymDesk uses anonymous QR badges. Each card carries a number and the member enters their PIN at the door."],t.s)
B.aDF=s(["Eskane + PIN an k\xe8k segonn","Scan + PIN en quelques secondes","Scan + PIN in seconds"],t.s)
B.bN0=s(["Prezante kat la devan kamera a oswa lekt\xe8 USB a, apre manm lan tape PIN li. Okenn enf\xf2masyon p\xe8son\xe8l pa par\xe8t san PIN.","Pr\xe9sentez la carte devant la cam\xe9ra ou le lecteur USB, puis le membre tape son PIN. Aucune information personnelle ne s\u2019affiche sans PIN.","Hold the card to the camera or USB reader, then the member types their PIN. No personal info shows without the PIN."],t.s)
B.bHN=s(["Mache menm san ent\xe8n\xe8t","Fonctionne m\xeame sans internet","Works even without internet"],t.s)
B.bGo=s(["Tout eskan, enskripsyon ak peye anrejistre lokalman epi yo senkronize otomatikman l\xe8 koneksyon an tounen.","Chaque scan, inscription et paiement est enregistr\xe9 localement puis synchronis\xe9 d\xe8s que la connexion revient.","Every scan, registration and payment is stored locally and syncs automatically when the connection returns."],t.s)
B.bnR=s(["Eseye gratis pandan 7 jou","Essayez gratuitement pendant 7 jours","Try it free for 7 days"],t.s)
B.bLR=s(["Kreye sal ou a, resevwa 10 kat es\xe8, envite ekip ou. Apre 7 jou an, senpman peye pou kontinye.","Cr\xe9ez votre salle, recevez 10 cartes d\u2019essai, invitez votre \xe9quipe. Apr\xe8s 7 jours, payez simplement pour continuer.","Create your gym, get 10 trial badges, invite your team. After 7 days, simply pay to continue."],t.s)
